<title>GERMANY: BOBSLEIGH-WORLD CUP TWO-MAN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BOBSLEIGH-WORLD CUP TWO-MAN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ALTENBERG, Germany 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from  the</p>
<p>two-man event at the opening World Cup meeting on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Pierre Lueders/Dave McEachern (Canada)  one minute 53.61</p>
<p>seconds (first run 56.43/second run 57.18)</p>
<p>2. Jim Herberich/Garett Hines (United States) 1:53.69</p>
<p>(56.73/56.96).</p>
<p>3. Matthias Benesch/Lars Bolte (Germany) 1:53.80 (56.50/57.30).</p>
<p>4. Sepp Dostthaler/Thomas Platzer (Germany) 1:53.83.</p>
<p>5. Guenther Huber/Massimiliano Rota (Italy) 1:54.15</p>
<p>(56.71/57.44).</p>
<p>6. Christoph Langen/Olaf Hampel (Germany) 1:54.24</p>
<p>(56.77/57.47).</p>
<p>7. Marcel Rohner/Thomas Schreiber (Switzerland) 1:54.33</p>
<p>(56.91/57.42).</p>
<p>8. Cris Lori/Sheridon Baptiste (Canada) 1:54.50 (56.92/57.58).</p>
<p>9. Reto Goetschi/Guido Acklin (Switzerland) 1:54.58</p>
<p>(57.45/57.13).</p>
<p>10. Sean Olsson/Lenny Paul (Britain) 1:54.63 (57.06/57.57).</p>
